SUMMARY:Agentic Coding with Azure Cosmos DB: From Idea to Working App
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat happens when you move beyond a
 utocomplete and start building applications with an AI coding agent as par
 t of your workflow? This session shows how developers can go from a prompt
  to a working Azure Cosmos DB application using agentic development tools\
 , while learning where agents accelerate work—and where human architectu
 re decisions still matter.\n\nCheck out the [CosmosDB Agent Kit](https://a
 ka.ms/CosmosDB-agentkit)\n\n📍 This session is a part of a series - lear
 n more [here](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1678/?wt.mc
 _id=meetup_27239_webpage_reactor)
